{"last_link_id": 24, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["你的任务是为文生图工具构建系统、精准的专业提示词体系，生成包含核心主题、风格特征、构图细节、光线效果等多维度关键元素的丰富提示词，并融入产品使用场景或主题相关的沉浸式环境描述以增强场景化表达。请仔细阅读以下用户提供的目标图像主题、风格要求及细节参数等需求，并严格遵循后续给出的提示词生成指南，产出符合要求的高质量提示词：\n\n目标图像主题：\n目标是为文生图工具构建专业提示词体系，针对电商产品广告（消费电子/美妆/家居等）、创意广告设计（视觉隐喻等手法）、专业摄影（产品/人像/场景等）三类主题，结合风格要求与构图、色彩、光线等多维度细节参数，遵循精准性、全面性、场景化等指南，生成包含核心主题、各细节维度、画质增强词的高质量提示词。关键元素包括核心主题明确、风格特征具体化、各细节维度描述精准、融入场景化表达及画质增强词。\n\n图像风格要求：\n请从以下风格类型中选择或提供具体风格方向：极简主义、复古风、未来主义、自然写实、梦幻童话、工业风、中国风等；若选择具体风格方向，请补充风格的核心视觉元素（如复古风可明确为适合电商产品广告的1950年代美式复古、适合摄影的民国复古等；中国风可明确为适合创意广告的敦煌壁画风、适合摄影的宋式美学等）\n\n\n图像细节参数：\n需包含以下维度的具体描述：\n1. 构图方式：如居中构图、黄金分割构图、对角线构图、对称构图等；\n2. 色彩搭配：如莫兰迪色系（可指定具体色调如灰粉色系、雾霾蓝系）、撞色对比（可指定具体颜色组合如克莱因蓝与亮黄）、高饱和度色彩、低饱和度色彩等；\n3. 光线效果：如柔和散射光（可说明光源类型如窗边自然光）、侧逆光（可补充光影效果如勾勒发丝轮廓）、硬光直射（可说明阴影特点如清晰锐利阴影）、伦勃朗光、蝴蝶光等；\n4. 材质质感：如哑光磨砂（可指定材质如陶瓷哑光）、金属反光（可说明光泽度如高光泽不锈钢）、丝绒质感（可补充触感联想如柔软细腻）、木质纹理（可指定木材类型如胡桃木）等；\n5. 背景元素：如纯白极简背景（可说明背景质感如无缝纯白背景布）、自然绿植环境（可指定植物种类如蕨类植物与龟背竹）、都市夜景背景（可补充元素如霓虹灯牌）、复古书房背景（可说明陈设如皮质沙发与旧书）等；\n6. 画质增强词：如8K resolution、photorealistic、highly detailed、ultra-realistic、cinematic lighting等；\n7. 额外场景元素：如产品使用场景（如咖啡杯置于木质书桌配书籍）、人物互动（如模特手持护肤品微笑）、氛围营造（如温暖治愈氛围）等。\n\n在生成提示词时，请遵循以下指南：\n1. 提示词需包含核心主题、风格特征、构图细节、色彩搭配、光线效果、材质质感、背景元素、额外场景元素等关键元素，确保维度全面且具体；\n2. 使用中文撰写提示词，采用逗号分隔不同描述维度，每个维度的描述需精准明确；\n3. 提示词应具体、明确，避免模糊表述（例如，不说\"漂亮的\"，而说\"精致的巴洛克风格雕花装饰的陶瓷花瓶\"；不说\"明亮的\"，而说\"清晨柔和的窗边散射光，照亮白色亚麻桌布\"）；\n4. 按重要性排序提示词元素，核心主题在前，风格特征、场景元素次之，细节描述（如光线、材质）随后，画质增强词在最后；\n5. 需适当添加\"highly detailed\"、\"8K resolution\"、\"photorealistic\"、\"ultra-realistic\"、\"cinematic lighting\"等增强图像质量与视觉效果的词汇；\n6. 交付标准\n- **结构要求**：中文Prompt为独立段落。\n- **格式要求**：纯文本输出，无任何标签、标记或格式符号。\n- **语言风格**：专业精准、视觉化表达、具备商业级创意张力与跨文化情感共鸣。\n- **长度控制**：每段Prompt需确保信息完整且简洁，融入多维度细节描述但避免冗余，总字数控制在250-350中文字符\n7. 若涉及产品广告主题，需补充产品的具体呈现方式（如产品置于画面中心，周围环绕相关装饰元素）或使用场景，增强广告的吸引力与代入感；若涉及创意广告设计，需补充创意概念（如通过光影对比突出产品特性）；若涉及摄影主题，需补充摄影类型（如人像摄影、产品摄影、风景摄影）与拍摄角度（如俯拍、仰拍、平视角度）。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "JjkText", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [666.7672729492188, 844.199951171875], "pos": [2543.56884765625, 330.3072509765625], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [2], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["3fc5b3acb3930d2b03bbbcec5567fe2f1cc77dad39006c0306402eb0a9a9e0c6.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [256.2017517089844, 326], "pos": [912.275634765625, 466.24212646484375], "id": 2, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#355", "groupcolor": "#8AA", "color": "#233"}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "describe", "links": [1, 23], "label": "describe", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "describe"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["gemini-3.1-pro-preview", 271197466, "randomize", "请帮我优化以下指令，让AI能够理解我的意图，适用于谷歌的nano banana这种对话式的AI图片生成平台，输出中文。\n\n我想根据图2的排列方式，帮我把图一衣服提取出来，将面料整理顺滑去除褶皱，纯白无缝背景，正面视角，平铺拍摄，置于纯白底图正中间，电商产品摄影，面料细节清晰，均匀布光，缝线工整，移除除衣服外多余的元素，高度保留衣服细节版型不变"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 2, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 21, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 22, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 24, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_Captioner_Pro", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [482.25872802734375, 400.63287353515625], "pos": [957.1065673828125, 1075.68994140625], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_Captioner_Pro", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#355", "groupcolor": "#8AA", "color": "#233"}}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [22], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["a2a95df02c1befc59ecc3ff9b08cea2288c1dcbb59c685c59f5b9468513299fe.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [248.88699340820312, 326], "pos": [1519.572021484375, 474.4656982421875], "id": 22, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#355", "groupcolor": "#8AA", "color": "#233"}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["", "", "txt", true], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 23, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "output_file_path"}, "name": "output_file_path", "label": "output_file_path", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_file_path"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_name"}, "name": "file_name", "label": "file_name", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "file_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "file_extension"}, "name": "file_extension", "label": "file_extension", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "file_extension"}, {"widget": {"name": "overwrite"}, "name": "overwrite", "label": "overwrite", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "overwrite"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy saveText", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [270, 150], "pos": [1905.1473388671875, 494.3067626953125], "id": 24, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy saveText", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#355", "groupcolor": "#8AA", "color": "#233"}}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["在像Nano Banana（或者Midjourney、DALL-E 3）这类对话式AI图片生成平台中，AI通常很难准确理解“图1”、“图2”这种相对代词，它更依赖于**直接、具体的画面描述**。\n\n你原始指令中存在一个小矛盾：你既要求了“图2的排列方式”（图2是四宫格、多角度），又要求了“正面视角”（单面）。\n\n为了让AI最精准地理解你的意图，我为你准备了两个版本的优化指令。你可以直接复制使用（请记得配合上传你想要提取衣服的**参考图/垫图**）。\n\n---\n\n### 选项一：如果你想要【一张图里包含4个角度（四宫格）】（参考图2的排版）\n\n**复制以下指令：**\n> 作为专业的电商产品摄影师，请帮我生成一张服装展示图。采用**四宫格（2x2）拼图排版**，展示一件【白色短袖Polo衫】*（注：请把这里改成你实际衣服的颜色和款式）*的四个不同视角（正面、背面、侧面、细节）。画面中**仅保留衣服本身，完全移除人物、模特及多余元素**（隐形模特/3D悬空展示）。所有视角的衣服均置于**纯白无缝背景**的正中间。面料整理得极其顺滑、去除所有褶皱，缝线工整，高度保留衣服的原始版型和细节。影棚级均匀布光，面料纹理清晰可见，8k分辨率，极致的电商主图质感。\n\n---\n\n### 选项二：如果你想要【一张纯正面的平铺大图】（最符合你文字后半段的描述）\n\n**复制以下指令：**\n> 专业的电商服装平铺摄影。画面正中间展示一件【灰色基础款短袖T恤】*（注：请把这里改成你实际衣服的颜色和款式）*，**纯正面视角，完美平铺拍摄**。画面中**只保留衣服**，彻底移除人物身体部件及其他多余元素。背景为纯白无缝底图（RGB 255,255,255）。衣服面料经过精心熨烫，极致顺滑无任何褶皱，缝线极其工整，严格保持衣服原有的版型轮廓。影棚级均匀柔光照明，无明显阴影，面料材质细节高度清晰，商品级高画质，8k分辨率。\n\n---\n\n### 💡 给你的 Nano Banana 出图小建议：\n\n1. **垫图（Image to Image）：** 仅仅靠文字AI很难100%还原衣服原貌。一定要把你想要提取衣服的那张图作为“参考图（Reference Image）”发给AI，并将**图像权重（Image Weight / CW）调高**，这样才能“高度保留衣服细节版型不变”。\n2. **替换括号内容：** 请把指令里 `【】` 框起来的衣服描述，精确替换为你垫图里的衣服（比如：黑色短袖、米色休闲裤等）。\n3. **负面提示词（Negative Prompts）：** 如果平台支持输入“不要什么”，强烈建议填入：`人物, 脸, 手, 脖子, 褶皱, 杂乱背景, 阴影, 衣架, 模特` (human, face, hands, neck, wrinkles, messy background, shadow, hanger, model)。这样能极大提高“提取衣服”的成功率。"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 1, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ShowText|pysssss", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [412.7378845214844, 681.1373901367188], "pos": [1516.6181640625, 1040.4107666015625], "id": 5, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss", "ttNbgOverride": {"bgcolor": "#355", "groupcolor": "#8AA", "color": "#233"}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [24], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["c1ffe5851b2f337d030e3afa5c0e997a50907ee9647e73aed104f82f0071e0fe.JPG", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "type": "LoadImage", "title": "图1", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [396.06658935546875, 557.8014526367188], "pos